# Modal panels and results
@scenario tutorial_lesson_37
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[stage clear]
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set tutorial_source scripts/tutorial/37_facet_return_values.vns]
[set tutorial_excerpt call_panel]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: A modal panel can send a result back to VNS. This progress card has Continue and Close. Try both and compare the next line.
@label lab
> Open the panel -> open_panel
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Practice exercise -> practice
> Review question -> check
@label open_panel
[set example_name "Modal result"]
[set example_progress 0.75]
# region call_panel
[screen call tutorial_card]
[if screen.return.tutorial_card == "continue" goto accepted]
# endregion
ginger: You closed the panel. No approval was recorded.
[jump lab]
@label accepted
ginger: You selected Continue. Edit the target of Continue in tutorial_card.facet. The script must test for the returned value.
[jump lab]
@label return_hub
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[if !tutorial_done_37]
[flag tutorial_done_37]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_8]
[end]

@label practice
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: If Continue is renamed on screen, what determines the branch?
> The translated button label. -> practice_hint
> The return action target. -> practice_result
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label practice_hint
ginger: The display text can change without changing the returned value.
[jump practice]
@label practice_result
ginger: The display text can change without changing the returned value.
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
> Review question -> check
> Try the interactive lab again -> start
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: Where does the selected button's result become available?
> The screen.return variable. -> correct
> The original progress number. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: A call waits for a return action and exposes its target as a variable.
[jump check]
@label correct
ginger: A call waits for a return action and exposes its target as a variable.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
